  🆕 🍇🍉

  💭 Exercises 🐠, a same-class error-prone generic initializer, with a description dynamically built from this
  💭 method's own unresolved T, matching the original leak (malloc'd here, must be freed by 🐠's own frame).
  ❗️ 🧪 v T fail 👌 🍇
    🆗 f 🆕🐠🐚T🍆 v fail❗️ 🍇🍉
    🙅 e 🍇 😀 🔤error🔤❗️ 🍉
  🍉

  💭 Exercises 🐟, which directly inherits 🐠's initializer without declaring one of its own: there is no owning
  💭 frame inside the inherited initializer, so this call site must free the dynamic description itself.
  ❗️ 🔬 v T fail 👌 🍇
    🆗 f 🆕🐟🐚T🍆 v fail❗️ 🍇🍉
    🙅 e 🍇 😀 🔤error🔤❗️ 🍉
  🍉

  💭 Same as 🔬, one level further removed from the declaring class.
  ❗️ 🧫 v T fail 👌 🍇
