    🙅 e 🍇 😀 🔤error🔤❗️ 🍉
  🍉

  💭 Exercises 🦑, which owns a frame (it declares its own field and calls 🐠's initializer explicitly), so this
  💭 call site must not free the description itself: 🦑's own frame must free it exactly once instead.
  ❗️ 🧬 v T raise 👌 🍇
    🆗 f 🆕🦑🐚T🍆 v raise❗️ 🍇🍉
    🙅 e 🍇 😀 🔤error🔤❗️ 🍉
